# No secondary buttons

Never use `Button` `variant="secondary"`. Use `variant="outline"` instead.

- Allowed button variants in product UI: `default`, `outline`, `ghost`, `destructive`, `success`, `link` (and size props as documented)
- Action-priority language in button groups (“primary → secondary → tertiary”) refers to **emphasis order**, not `variant="secondary"`
- Do not reintroduce `secondary` on the Button primitive

```tsx
// ✅
<Button variant="outline">View</Button>

// ❌
<Button variant="secondary">View</Button>
```

See `design.md` → UI copy → Buttons.
